              "eligibility.program.title": "FSA Beginning Farmer classification requirements",
              "eligibility.program.description": "Application guidance for FSA beginning-farmer loans from the official FSA pages: where to apply, what to bring, the Down Payment Loan cash requirement, entity rules, and where deadlines are published. The eligibility statements are the same partial transcription as the farm-loan criteria record; only the years-operated clause is mapped. Published application forms, phone numbers and deadlines are not stated on the reviewed pages.",
